{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Toothpicks of equal length are used to build a rectangular grid as shown. If the grid is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> toothpicks high and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> toothpicks wide, then the number of toothpicks used is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/45437ff6d91a8f82d98762322ec463f1433d8576.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] real xscl = 1; int[] x = {0,1,2,4,5},y={0,1,3,4,5}; for(int a:x) { pair prev = (a,y[0]); for(int i = 1;i&lt;y.length;++i) { pair p = (a,y[i]); pen pen = linewidth(1); if(y[i]-prev.y!=1){  pen+=dotted; } draw((xscl*prev.x,prev.y)--(xscl*p.x,p.y),pen); prev = p; } }for(int a:y) { pair prev = (x[0],a); for(int i = 1;i&lt;x.length;++i) { pair p = (x[i],a); pen pen = linewidth(1); if(x[i]-prev.x!=1){  pen+=dotted; } draw((xscl*prev.x,prev.y)--(p.x*xscl,p.y),pen); prev = p; } } path lblx = (0,-.7)--(5*xscl,-.7); draw(lblx, arrow=Arrows(), bar=Bars); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,lblx, align=(0,0), filltype=Fill(white)); path lbly = (5*xscl+.7,0)--(5*xscl+.7,5); draw(lbly, arrow=Arrows(), bar=Bars); label(&quot;$20$&quot;,lbly, align=(0,0), filltype=Fill(white));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a267d8f87ae22f4742b650f0332e93e1f28c9b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textrm{(A)}\\ 30\\qquad\\textrm{(B)}\\ 200\\qquad\\textrm{(C)}\\ 410\\qquad\\textrm{(D)}\\ 420\\qquad\\textrm{(E)}\\ 430$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The grid consists of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/8/4882a22019c436320012612562d19e8aaf3ba5b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20+1=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> horizontal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-toothpick segments, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/e/e1e719e454ce668838db9d571dfdc427e7044272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10+1=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> vertical <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-toothpick segments, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/d/19d4c7a58d6ed0354e6ae83671ee9305a10c434e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21\\cdot10+11\\cdot20=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 430}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"219\" height=\"30\" /> toothpicks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/8/f1851f7805bf60317c9acb84ce33d853432f75fe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] path p,q; for(int i=0;i&lt;3;++i) {   for(int j=3;j&lt;6;++j) {     p = (i+0.75,j)--(i,j)--(i,j-0.75);     draw(p);     dot((i,j));   } } for(int i=0;i&lt;3;++i) {   q = (i,0)--(i+0.75,0);   draw(q);dot((i,0));   q = (5,5-i)--(5,4.25-i);   draw(q);dot((5,5-i)); } draw((4,0)--(4.75,0));dot((4,0)); draw((5,1)--(5,0.25));dot((5,1)); draw((3,2)--(4,1),dotted); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Divide the figure into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79530a1f63db9d38a4612560bb7df81dfe7e6ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\cdot 10 = 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" /> L-shaped joints, the right edge, and the bottom edge.  It becomes clear that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b37a8f5e997ef132821d8929709fafec1de678b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot200+20+10=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 430}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"228\" height=\"30\" /> toothpicks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"